StandardScaler → SVC(linear, C=0.1)
feature_order fixed by the artifact" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="300" width="300" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="threshold" value="Decision threshold
P(fake) ≥ 0.70" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="440" width="300" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="final" value="Final Prediction
REAL  /  FAKE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b6d7a8;strokeColor=#38761d;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="540" width="300" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="g_entry" value="Entry points — all three run this identical path" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbf0;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7f6000;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="910" width="1570" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_cli" value="classify.py  /  classify
one detector resident at a time · score cache" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="950" width="480" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_nb" value="notebooks/06_Full_Pipeline
gallery + metrics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="950" width="460" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_kaggle" value="Kaggle: aigc-detector-benchmark
T4 · 13,843 images · 111 min" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="950" width="490" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hw4" value="HARDWARE — device is auto-selected CUDA → MPS → CPU (Modeling/common/device.py); no code path hardcodes a device.
Peak VRAM is one detector, not three: each is constructed, used, then freed. Measured throughput 0.48 s/image on a Tesla T4; ~1.3 s/image on Apple MPS. CPU works and is slower.
Disk at rest: 1.2 GB DINOv3-L + 9.8 MB stacking + 8 KB fusion, plus ~1.5 GB of Hugging Face backbone cache on first run." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="762" width="1440" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note4" value="Artifacts loaded: weights/dinov3/notebook_dinov3/best_robust.pt · weights/stacking/notebook_vitb/best_robust.pt · weights/fusion/selected_final_fusion.joblib
Crop sampling is seeded by each image's position within its batch, so a probability is reproducible for a given input set but shifts slightly when the same image is scored alongside a different set." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="842" width="1440" height="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="input" target="c1_bb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="input" target="c2_crop"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="input" target="c3_crop"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1_bb" target="c1_head"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="k5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1_head" target="c1_prob"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
